issing/edgeTargetMissing) and already showed in the panel on main in en and zh, so no second check was added; the repeated pair was not flagged anywhere (the card's published flow read 'No problems'). H5 client problems feed only the banner, badges, red ring/stroke and panel; nothing on the Studio save/publish path reads them, so an author with a dangling or repeated edge can still save and publish until objectstack#22088 lands, and repairs by clicking the row to select the edge and removing it in the edge inspector. No public surface change (changed d.ts not reachable from dist/index.d.ts). Patch changeset.",
